'''Li'l Sakura''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained when beating any stage in [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event#The Hidden Grail War|The Hidden Grail War]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 374
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Li'l Sakura
|name2 = Li'l Sakura CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Sakura CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Li'l Sakura is very much like [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]]: an early game critter, and completely outclassed by [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]]. If that wasn't enough, this unit also has an extremely long cooldown time for its terrible stats, meaning it has no use apart from very early game metals like [[Metal Hippoe]].

